{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"My body still bears it but, my soul is free of the stains.\" A raven hops off her antlers and perches on her finger.","created_at":"2021-07-19T00:18:41.970000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866474092533907467","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"How?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T00:18:52.548000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866474136900993064","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"After our adventure in the Noir, I... I realize I couldn't pushing it back behind me.\" She wraps a stray lock of hair around an antler. \"The ravens helped. I could take you to them, if you'd like?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T00:19:57.767000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866474410449043496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"What did they ask in return?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T00:20:18.296000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866474496554696764","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"A promise. No different from the one that changed me before.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T00:21:02.681000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866474682718617640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
